# Gate step 1648-gy9z — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# WHAT IT GUARDS. 793-a8e7 S4: on the WSL2 Vulkan opt-in lane a GPU runner that
# stops making progress is killed and its model quarantined to the CPU through
# the decode-floor pin record (restored on opt-out), and a runner the watchdog
# cannot read is logged as blind and NEVER killed (coordinator condition
# 2026-10-12). The subject is images/inference/gpu-stall-watchdog.sh.
#
# The step RUNS the watchdog tick by tick against a fake process table, a stub
# curl (/slots and /api/ps), a stub ollama store and a recording kill: advancing
# progress, a stall below and past the threshold, three blind arms (slots
# unreachable, unrecognised shape, unattributable model), an idle runner, and
# the quarantine restored on opt-out. Pre-fix: no watchdog; sabotages (killing
# an unattributable stall, dropping the threshold) each turn it red.
#
# STEP_LUA is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
